# POST http://localhost:3000/update_profile_picture HTTP/1.1
# Content-Type: application/json

# {
#     "profile_picture": "doraemon_profile.webp",
#     "token": "534b398be276dc3fbaae7893ffb8dc43be1928cd8cfe5789a7d573b3ec74d118"
# }
# we can't upload files using 'api.http' , for that we need to use 'HOPPSCOTCH'
# Through 'HOPPSCOTCH' it can be done as: (i) switch to 'Body' section, (ii) choose Content-Type: multipart/form-data --> then select 'choose file'


